OL,3,GNEWSADigital Greenhouse closure 'deeply
OL,4,Adisappointing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn organisation that represents
OL,7,Fbusinesses said it was "deeply
OL,8,Fdisappointed" by the decision to close
OL,9,Fa government-funded centre for digital
OL,10,Fand creative start-ups.
OL,12,FThe States of Guernsey announced the
OL,13,FDigital Greenhouse, which opened in
OL,14,F2016, would close in its current form
OL,15,Funless a private company or charity
OL,16,Fcame forward to run it.
OL,18,FThis comes after former Commerce and
OL,19,FEmployment Minister Kevin Stewart, who
OL,20,Fhelped create the centre, said the
OL,21,Fdecision was "absolutely crazy".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
