OL,3,GNEWSADigital Greenhouse closure 'deeply
OL,4,Adisappointing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey Chamber of Commerce released a
OL,7,Fstatement on Tuesday saying it was
OL,8,F"extremely concerned about the vacuum"
OL,9,Fthe decision would leave.
